flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[User Login / Register]
    B --> C[JWT Authentication]
    C --> D[Dashboard]

    D --> E[Create / Select Project]
    E --> F[Add Target URL or IP]
    F --> G{Scope Permission Check}

    G -->|Out of Scope| X[Block Scan and Show Warning]
    G -->|In Scope| H[Configure Scan]

    H --> I[Create Scan Job]
    I --> J[Scanner Engine]

    J --> J1[Nmap Scan]
    J --> J2[Nikto Scan]
    J --> J3[SQLmap Scan]
    J --> J4[Custom Web Checks]

    J1 --> K[Collect Raw Tool Output]
    J2 --> K
    J3 --> K
    J4 --> K

    K --> L[Parse and Normalise Results]
    L --> M[Map Vulnerabilities: CVE, CWE, OWASP Top 10]

    M --> N[Store Findings in MySQL]
    N --> O[AI Recommendation Engine]

    O --> P[Generate Attack Suggestions]
    O --> Q[Generate Risk Explanation]
    O --> R[Generate Remediation Advice]

    P --> S[Tester Review]
    Q --> S
    R --> S

    S --> T{Accept Suggestion?}
    T -->|No| U[Add Manual Notes]
    T -->|Yes| V[Save Evidence]

    U --> V
    V --> W[Generate Report]
    W --> Y[Export PDF, DOCX or HTML]
    Y --> Z([End])